{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CEQK0ftAKW1793601621.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>警方拘捕一名男子涉嫌狂亂駕駛，撞毀港珠澳大橋檢查亭。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ARREST-1230_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026p9DGpDhnuh1793596722.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>網上片段見到，多輛警車嘗試阻截一名黑色私家車，有交通警企圖制止。另一條片段見到，大批警員在屯門海皇路拘捕一名男子。據了解，疑犯凌晨一時許駕駛私家車，在港珠澳大橋香港口岸撞閘，撞毀檢查亭逃走。警方透過「銳眼計劃」追蹤私家車，早上在屯門拘捕疑犯。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:41:06.913487+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T10:18:34.180058+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T07:38:29.285729+00:00","content_hash":"f7d7c9b712cfec0783d0a2b7916c468c431c53dd3b7171d484e65916302bb6d5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:41:06.913487+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}